{"version":1,"content":"<p>視帝譚俊彥（Shaun）與太太任祉妍結婚多年恩愛如昔，二人婚後育有一子一女，一家四口生活美滿。</p><p>出名「愛妻號」的譚俊彥近日趁空檔帶太太和一對仔女到富國島度假，任𧘲妍連日於社交網晒靚相，趁着美好陽光與沙灘上留倩影，穿上一件頭泳裝的她，身材弗到漏</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:21:59.685946+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:01:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:16.042238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:16.042238+00:00","content_hash":"52976c7decc5df7e45a20a9021c7c254d296da96b1e9bd03baeb082e85535a35","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}